│                                                              ││                                                                                              │
│                                                              ││                                                                                              │
│                                                              ││  Pull Requests                                                                               │
│                                                              ││                                                                                              │
│                                                              ││  You can interact with a PR by viewing its details, viewing the PR diff, and participating   │
│                                                              ││  in any active conversations happening on the PR. You can also create a new PR for the       │
│                                                              ││  currently selected repo.                                                                    │
│                                                              ││                                                                                              │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘│                                                                                              │
