│ #  Status  Author  Title                                     ││                                                                                              │
│                                                              ││  You can interact with an issue by viewing its details, partipcating in any activate         │
│                                                              ││  conversations happening on the issue, and by editing the issue itself. This means that you  │
│                                                              ││  can close an issue from within LazyGithub.                                                  │
│                                                              ││                                                                                              │
